<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 219 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 219 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 219 all out in their first innings on the first day of the third test at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Thursday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia 219 all out in 74.5 overs (Greg Blewett 62, Steve Waugh 58) v West Indies.</p>
